{"id":"4e0a05ab276dc277","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-proof.md","title":"Proof","display":"df-proof — Proof","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-proof","aliases":["93-df-proof"],"display":"df-proof — Proof","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof — Proof"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is an arbitrary formula set and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=\\langle F,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal P=\\langle F,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\rangle\\)</span> is a deductive-calculus candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq F\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(F)\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(F)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(p)=n+1\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(p)=n+1\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in F\">\\(\\varphi\\in F\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\langle F,A,\\mathcal R\\rangle}\\coloneqq A,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\langle F,A,\\mathcal R\\rangle}\\coloneqq\\mathcal R\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\langle F,A,\\mathcal R\\rangle}\\coloneqq A,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\langle F,A,\\mathcal R\\rangle}\\coloneqq\\mathcal R\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal P=\\langle F,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq F\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\wp(\\mathrm{Seq}(F)\\times F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal P=\\langle F,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq F\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\wp(\\mathrm{Seq}(F)\\times F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists F\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\land\\varphi\\in F\\\\\n&amp;\\land p\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(F)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)=n+1\\land p(n)=\\varphi\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;n+1\\;\\Bigl(p(i)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\lor\n\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\;\\exists q\\in\n\\mathrm{Seq}(\\{p(j):j&lt;i\\})\\;(\\langle q,p(i)\\rangle\\in R)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists F\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\land\\varphi\\in F\\\\\n&amp;\\land p\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(F)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)=n+1\\land p(n)=\\varphi\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;n+1\\;\\Bigl(p(i)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\lor\n\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\;\\exists q\\in\n\\mathrm{Seq}(\\{p(j):j&lt;i\\})\\;(\\langle q,p(i)\\rangle\\in R)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\varnothing)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\varnothing)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rules have variable finite arity through a finite premise sequence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>; the previous free <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> and indices <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_1,\\ldots,j_k\">\\(j_1,\\ldots,j_k\\)</span> are eliminated. Premises are a fourth argument rather than being unioned with the calculus object.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P=\\langle F,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq F","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(p)=n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\langle F,A,\\mathcal R\\rangle}\\coloneqq A,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\langle F,A,\\mathcal R\\rangle}\\coloneqq\\mathcal R","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal P=\\langle F,\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P},\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq F\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq\\wp(\\mathrm{Seq}(F)\\times F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists F\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\land\\varphi\\in F\\\\\n&\\land p\\in\\mathrm{Seq}(F)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(p)=n+1\\land p(n)=\\varphi\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<n+1\\;\\Bigl(p(i)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal P}\\lor\n\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{Rules}_{\\mathcal P}\\;\\exists q\\in\n\\mathrm{Seq}(\\{p(j):j<i\\})\\;(\\langle q,p(i)\\rangle\\in R)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\varnothing)","display":true},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"j_1,\\ldots,j_k","display":false}],"bytes":1934,"backlinks":[{"id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7480655210b09b5d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma)$ is the four-place proof predicate of [[93-df-proof]]."},{"id":"ba86732612230e2a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a32f7aa28ab29ca","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dfc176599ab6a95f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2693d6bd81a90afb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Seq}(F)$ is the finite-sequence set used by [[93-df-proof]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-proof]]"}],"outgoing":["e30eac382dc7d1a7"]}